(5889008, 856615, 100335, '<td valign="top">This should do very well. Can immediately see the professional lighting. This should take blue in my opinion. At least top 3.</td>', 'This should do very well. Can immediately see the professional lighting. This should take blue in my opinion. At least top 3.', '2010-03-03 15:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889014, 857709, 100335, '<td valign="top">Is that a toy hand? haha nice one. I get the feeling this is either the kind of image that will do extremely well or very badly. I can''t say i don''t like it. its pretty nicely lit bringing out plenty of texture. I definitely love the spot light effect. For basic editing u did a good job.</td>', 'Is that a toy hand? haha nice one. I get the feeling this is either the kind of image that will do extremely well or very badly. I can''t say i don''t like it. its pretty nicely lit bringing out plenty of texture. I definitely love the spot light effect. For basic editing u did a good job.', '2010-03-03 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889018, 858093, 100335, '<td valign="top">This gets high scores, should do well in my opinion. Top 10 at the least.</td>', 'This gets high scores, should do well in my opinion. Top 10 at the least.', '2010-03-03 16:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889031, 857924, 100335, '<td valign="top">Easily a top 5 contender. Very nicely lit. You must be grumbling about the dark corner on the bottom and top left. I wont knock off anything because of it :P. Great job.</td>', 'Easily a top 5 contender. Very nicely lit. You must be grumbling about the dark corner on the bottom and top left. I wont knock off anything because of it :P. Great job.', '2010-03-03 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
