(5889036, 858017, 100335, '<td valign="top">nooo not again. lol</td>', 'nooo not again. lol', '2010-03-03 16:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889038, 858077, 100335, '<td valign="top">my eyes....  0_0</td>', 'my eyes....  0_0', '2010-03-03 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889043, 857132, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like. but two things if u don''t mind my personal feedback. I think there''s too much black space on the right. The composition is a little awkward for me. The framing isn''t helping either. The eggshell looks like its hugging the white border. But looking at subject itself regardless of composition its nicely done.</td>', 'I like. but two things if u don''t mind my personal feedback. I think there''s too much black space on the right. The composition is a little awkward for me. The framing isn''t helping either. The eggshell looks like its hugging the white border. But looking at subject itself regardless of composition its nicely done.', '2010-03-03 16:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889044, 857863, 100335, '<td valign="top">spray painted storm troopers would have given it a uniform look. Just a thought. <br/> <br/>Very funny and original overall.</td>', 'spray painted storm troopers would have given it a uniform look. Just a thought.  Very funny and original overall.', '2010-03-03 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889046, 857768, 100335, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing here.</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing here.', '2010-03-03 16:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889053, 858177, 100335, '<td valign="top">This is risky. Nice, but risky. A slightly non-calibrated monitor will have this look too bright. Its nice but not saying much in the creativity department. I do appreciate the technical difficulty of this though.</td>', 'This is risky. Nice, but risky. A slightly non-calibrated monitor will have this look too bright. Its nice but not saying much in the creativity department. I do appreciate the technical difficulty of this though.', '2010-03-03 16:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889057, 857401, 61961, '<td valign="top">You may not know that printing is not allowed on a photo, though I''ll give you the benefit while voting and assume the words were printed on a sign hanging above the egg (however unlikely).  Will be curious to read how you lit this.  Good concept -- I remember the original Alien poster very well!</td>', 'You may not know that printing is not allowed on a photo, though I''ll give you the benefit while voting and assume the words were printed on a sign hanging above the egg (however unlikely).  Will be curious to read how you lit this.  Good concept -- I remember the original Alien poster very well!', '2010-03-03 16:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889060, 857530, 100335, '<td valign="top">Funny expression. Different. Unique. Its not a bowl of friggin eggs. Its not an egg sitting on flippin two criscrossed forks (can you tell i''m frustrated and happy to see something fresh and different??)<br/> <br/>I think some people missed the challenge description that said "Be creative and have fun" I''m glad to see you haven''t. 8!</td>', 'Funny expression. Different. Unique. Its not a bowl of friggin eggs. Its not an egg sitting on flippin two criscrossed forks (can you tell i''m frustrated and happy to see something fresh and different??) I think some people missed the challenge description that said "Be creative and have fun" I''m glad to see you haven''t. 8!', '2010-03-03 16:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889061, 858176, 61961, '<td valign="top">I suspect this was intended for the Parallel Lines challenge, though conceivably each little white bristle head could be considered egg-shaped, so no DNMC from me!</td>', 'I suspect this was intended for the Parallel Lines challenge, though conceivably each little white bristle head could be considered egg-shaped, so no DNMC from me!', '2010-03-03 16:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889067, 858044, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m seeing, nor am I sure I need to know.  Seems a bit more like a pancake than an egg! I''ll be curious to read how you did this.  :-)</td>', 'Not sure what I''m seeing, nor am I sure I need to know.  Seems a bit more like a pancake than an egg! I''ll be curious to read how you did this.  :-)', '2010-03-03 16:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889071, 857924, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, clarity, and exposure.  Could *maybe* use more reflected light from the right.  Very nice concept.</td>', 'Beautiful color, clarity, and exposure.  Could *maybe* use more reflected light from the right.  Very nice concept.', '2010-03-03 16:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889074, 857773, 61961, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very attractive.  Good control of exposure.  Well done (or should that be hard boiled?)!</td>', 'Simple yet very attractive.  Good control of exposure.  Well done (or should that be hard boiled?)!', '2010-03-03 16:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889076, 858021, 61961, '<td valign="top">I can see the sunrise, though my first impression is of something shooting through deep space.  I like the contrast and the way the egg glows.</td>', 'I can see the sunrise, though my first impression is of something shooting through deep space.  I like the contrast and the way the egg glows.', '2010-03-03 16:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889079, 858057, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  I think I''d like to see the whole egg in focus (but hey, it''s your photo).  I assume this required some mouse wrangling -- and that no animals were harmed in the making of this photograph.</td>', 'Sweet!  I think I''d like to see the whole egg in focus (but hey, it''s your photo).  I assume this required some mouse wrangling -- and that no animals were harmed in the making of this photograph.', '2010-03-03 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889086, 857763, 61961, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about obvious anthromorphism in concept or title, but I like this very much anyway.  Nicely lit, good colors, and effective I think on almost a subconcious level.</td>', 'Not crazy about obvious anthromorphism in concept or title, but I like this very much anyway.  Nicely lit, good colors, and effective I think on almost a subconcious level.', '2010-03-03 16:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889090, 856615, 61961, '<td valign="top">Excellent control of exposure for this white-on-white.  I don''t find the ring so appealing, but I don''t mean to insult your jewelry!  It just seems less "pure" than the other materials.  Overall very good job.</td>', 'Excellent control of exposure for this white-on-white.  I don''t find the ring so appealing, but I don''t mean to insult your jewelry!  It just seems less "pure" than the other materials.  Overall very good job.', '2010-03-03 16:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889093, 857373, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think your yolk and eggwhite could be in sharper focus, but overall this makes a striking graphic.</td>', 'I think your yolk and eggwhite could be in sharper focus, but overall this makes a striking graphic.', '2010-03-03 16:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889096, 857812, 100335, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2010-03-03 16:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889097, 857868, 100335, '<td valign="top">I like this, the black rings do well to give the egg shape and dimension. I think theres a little too much white space thought. Regardless, high scorer and top 3 I''m thinking.</td>', 'I like this, the black rings do well to give the egg shape and dimension. I think theres a little too much white space thought. Regardless, high scorer and top 3 I''m thinking.', '2010-03-03 16:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5889101, 858168, 61961, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, colors, and especially textures.  Would possibly like a closer view/crop.  Great old skillet, though.</td>', 'Cool effect, colors, and especially textures.  Would possibly like a closer view/crop.  Great old skillet, though.', '2010-03-03 16:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
