(5891750, 858037, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the delicacy and the elegance in this .  Very nice texture study</td>', 'I love the delicacy and the elegance in this .  Very nice texture study', '2010-03-05 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891753, 858221, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I like the simplistic black and white, and the way the roundness of the egg breaks up the parallel lines of the piano.  Great shot</td>', 'Excellent.  I like the simplistic black and white, and the way the roundness of the egg breaks up the parallel lines of the piano.  Great shot', '2010-03-05 16:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891768, 858178, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is really superb, and the colors are very "soothing."  The slightly uneven background, though, makes it feel a little lopsided to me (and I am often the only one, so I think my head is crooked or something).  Aside from the high quality, technically, it just doesn''t "grab" me or intrigue me or tell me any kind of story.</td>', 'The lighting on this is really superb, and the colors are very "soothing."  The slightly uneven background, though, makes it feel a little lopsided to me (and I am often the only one, so I think my head is crooked or something).  Aside from the high quality, technically, it just doesn''t "grab" me or intrigue me or tell me any kind of story.', '2010-03-05 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891769, 857866, 811, '<td valign="top">this made me laugh</td>', 'this made me laugh', '2010-03-05 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891770, 857999, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light here and the pattern the shadows make</td>', 'I like the use of light here and the pattern the shadows make', '2010-03-05 16:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891774, 857202, 811, '<td valign="top">I would have never, in a thousand years, thought of combining an egg and a chainsaw for a picture.  I can''t decide if it is cool, or disturbing.  :P</td>', 'I would have never, in a thousand years, thought of combining an egg and a chainsaw for a picture.  I can''t decide if it is cool, or disturbing.  :P', '2010-03-05 16:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891775, 857763, 811, '<td valign="top">Bad pun :), pretty good picture though.  I like the contrasting colors</td>', 'Bad pun :), pretty good picture though.  I like the contrasting colors', '2010-03-05 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891776, 858200, 811, '<td valign="top">Good high key effect and excellent control of light.  Compositionally, it feels off to me.  I think perhaps because the egg on the left is so much closer to the edge than the one on the right.  Or maybe if there was a lot of negative space on the top and right.  As it is, there is too much space to feel truly balanced, but not enough to effectively use negative space.</td>', 'Good high key effect and excellent control of light.  Compositionally, it feels off to me.  I think perhaps because the egg on the left is so much closer to the edge than the one on the right.  Or maybe if there was a lot of negative space on the top and right.  As it is, there is too much space to feel truly balanced, but not enough to effectively use negative space.', '2010-03-05 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891778, 857053, 811, '<td valign="top">hahahahahha -- love the hat</td>', 'hahahahahha -- love the hat', '2010-03-05 16:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891781, 858070, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this.  the hash marks really add to the shot</td>', 'I like the composition of this.  the hash marks really add to the shot', '2010-03-05 16:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891784, 857132, 811, '<td valign="top">this has that clean lighting and clarity that reminds me of eyewave''s stuff (i think he is h2 now). very nicely executed</td>', 'this has that clean lighting and clarity that reminds me of eyewave''s stuff (i think he is h2 now). very nicely executed', '2010-03-05 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891786, 857868, 811, '<td valign="top">To me, this is the penultimate minimalist shot.  I like -- a lot</td>', 'To me, this is the penultimate minimalist shot.  I like -- a lot', '2010-03-05 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5891788, 858052, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus could be just a hair sharper on the foremost egg, but I like the tight crop and the softness of this.</td>', 'The focus could be just a hair sharper on the foremost egg, but I like the tight crop and the softness of this.', '2010-03-05 17:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
