(5891999, 858093, 35560, '<td valign="top">Amazing - it really does work as a "Magic Eye" picture ... not sure if that''s a copyrighted term?  Anyhow, points for originality.</td>', 'Amazing - it really does work as a "Magic Eye" picture ... not sure if that''s a copyrighted term?  Anyhow, points for originality.', '2010-03-05 21:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5892002, 858174, 35560, '<td valign="top">Well I would just love this if the egg, being the subject of the challenge, was sharper.  Without a doubt, the kitty is adorable, and more in focus on the face, and I love the fur detail.  I think you may get points deducted for focus though.</td>', 'Well I would just love this if the egg, being the subject of the challenge, was sharper.  Without a doubt, the kitty is adorable, and more in focus on the face, and I love the fur detail.  I think you may get points deducted for focus though.', '2010-03-05 21:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5892004, 858058, 35560, '<td valign="top">I could eat this - what a delicious looking picture. I''m not wild about the artifacts around the asparagus on top of the picture, and some of the blurring looks like it was done in processing, and not depth of field? But I do like the composition and layout.</td>', 'I could eat this - what a delicious looking picture. I''m not wild about the artifacts around the asparagus on top of the picture, and some of the blurring looks like it was done in processing, and not depth of field? But I do like the composition and layout.', '2010-03-05 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5892009, 858195, 35560, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to work out what I''m looking at...sprinkles melted on an egg?  Makes me shudder!  But certainly is eyecatching and creative.</td>', 'Took me a minute to work out what I''m looking at...sprinkles melted on an egg?  Makes me shudder!  But certainly is eyecatching and creative.', '2010-03-05 21:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
