(5897060, 857773, 115436, '<td valign="top">If you look at your image and blur your eyes its almost as if the brown egg is actually a yolk and the snow around it is the white of a broken egg. (does that make sense?) It makes your picture fun to look at in various ways :)<br/> <br/>The black corners are a bit distracting.<br/> <br/>The image is done well but it just doesn''t connect with me.</td>', 'If you look at your image and blur your eyes its almost as if the brown egg is actually a yolk and the snow around it is the white of a broken egg. (does that make sense?) It makes your picture fun to look at in various ways :) The black corners are a bit distracting. The image is done well but it just doesn''t connect with me.', '2010-03-09 17:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897065, 856620, 115436, '<td valign="top">Oh very cool!<br/>If you look carefully you can see thin spots in the surrounding eggs - its almost like little stars.  In the eccentric parts of my mind, I imagine a little chick in there looking up to see their own little universe.</td>', 'Oh very cool!If you look carefully you can see thin spots in the surrounding eggs - its almost like little stars.  In the eccentric parts of my mind, I imagine a little chick in there looking up to see their own little universe.', '2010-03-09 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897071, 858059, 115436, '<td valign="top">Slimy! Messy! Glad you did it and not me ;)<br/>The flash is a bit harsh.<br/>There''s a sick part of me that actually wants to see the end of the little yolk strand that''s going off the page.</td>', 'Slimy! Messy! Glad you did it and not me ;)The flash is a bit harsh.There''s a sick part of me that actually wants to see the end of the little yolk strand that''s going off the page.', '2010-03-09 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897084, 858184, 115436, '<td valign="top">Dinosaur eggs! And the red one is about to hatch Godzilla!<br/> <br/>That''s the first thing that came to my mind when I saw your image pop up on my screen! :)</td>', 'Dinosaur eggs! And the red one is about to hatch Godzilla! That''s the first thing that came to my mind when I saw your image pop up on my screen! :)', '2010-03-09 18:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897090, 858191, 115436, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.<br/>It looks like a monster coming up out of a pool of slime, jaws open wide.<br/> <br/>I almost wish the container wasn''t visible!<br/> <br/>I like looking (and relooking) at the egg shell - it''s quite interesting.</td>', 'Disturbing.It looks like a monster coming up out of a pool of slime, jaws open wide. I almost wish the container wasn''t visible! I like looking (and relooking) at the egg shell - it''s quite interesting.', '2010-03-09 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897096, 858057, 115436, '<td valign="top">lol that''s just cute!<br/>How''d you ever get the mouse to stay in the egg?<br/> <br/>Fun to look at and the composition is nice too.</td>', 'lol that''s just cute!How''d you ever get the mouse to stay in the egg? Fun to look at and the composition is nice too.', '2010-03-09 18:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897099, 856358, 115436, '<td valign="top">Aah! Another messy one! <br/>This idea would''ve been really interesting under different lighting and against a different background.  I keep trying to straighten the lines of the tiles out in my mind!<br/> <br/>The way the egg "goos" everywhere is fun to look at though!</td>', 'Aah! Another messy one! This idea would''ve been really interesting under different lighting and against a different background.  I keep trying to straighten the lines of the tiles out in my mind! The way the egg "goos" everywhere is fun to look at though!', '2010-03-09 18:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897101, 857047, 115436, '<td valign="top">And I thought the other egg smashy pictures were disturbing! :)<br/> <br/>I enjoy the lighting and the way the eye peeks out at you from the shell.  <br/>I''m not such a fan of the little saw - I think the picture would''ve been just fine (if not better!) without it :)</td>', 'And I thought the other egg smashy pictures were disturbing! :) I enjoy the lighting and the way the eye peeks out at you from the shell.  I''m not such a fan of the little saw - I think the picture would''ve been just fine (if not better!) without it :)', '2010-03-09 18:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897104, 858202, 115436, '<td valign="top">lol his eyes give a more shocked impression though! :)<br/> <br/>I''m guessing the white thing around it is a plate? bowl maybe? <br/>Its looking a bit noisy and the picture, overall, could''ve been a bit sharper.</td>', 'lol his eyes give a more shocked impression though! :) I''m guessing the white thing around it is a plate? bowl maybe? Its looking a bit noisy and the picture, overall, could''ve been a bit sharper.', '2010-03-09 18:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897122, 857868, 115436, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice to look at.</td>', 'Simple and nice to look at.', '2010-03-09 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897126, 858090, 115436, '<td valign="top">A bit too small and out of focus for my tastes.  I''d be interested to know what the eggs are resting on though!</td>', 'A bit too small and out of focus for my tastes.  I''d be interested to know what the eggs are resting on though!', '2010-03-09 18:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897219, 858052, 110300, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus, maybe you intended that, but i dont think it works</td>', 'seems out of focus, maybe you intended that, but i dont think it works', '2010-03-09 19:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897273, 857202, 112781, '<td valign="top">If your gonna do something, why not go all out!  I love how its just complete overkill.  Excellent shot, great focus on the egg and stand.  I like how there is no motion blur on the egg  and most of the gooey yolk is in focus and tapers off the frame in a blur.</td>', 'If your gonna do something, why not go all out!  I love how its just complete overkill.  Excellent shot, great focus on the egg and stand.  I like how there is no motion blur on the egg  and most of the gooey yolk is in focus and tapers off the frame in a blur.', '2010-03-09 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897277, 858190, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very bright &amp; cheerful colors and the lighting is well done. I think the glassy eggs merge with the glazed ceramic bowl and the sheen of the fabric background and they really don''t stand out as they should. Also the background colors are very similar instead of being complimentary.</td>', 'Very bright & cheerful colors and the lighting is well done. I think the glassy eggs merge with the glazed ceramic bowl and the sheen of the fabric background and they really don''t stand out as they should. Also the background colors are very similar instead of being complimentary.', '2010-03-09 19:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897280, 858070, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very humorous photo! I like that the chick is oof due to the depth of field. I just tink it is so out of focus to make it not be a part of the scene. I would recommend a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Very humorous photo! I like that the chick is oof due to the depth of field. I just tink it is so out of focus to make it not be a part of the scene. I would recommend a smaller aperture.', '2010-03-09 19:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897281, 857373, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Eggcellent!!</b></td>', 'Eggcellent!!', '2010-03-09 19:58:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5897285, 858069, 10785, '<td valign="top">Such a great photo. I am just confused as to why the pastel stripes fade to black on the left. It seems out of place.</td>', 'Such a great photo. I am just confused as to why the pastel stripes fade to black on the left. It seems out of place.', '2010-03-09 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897290, 858213, 10785, '<td valign="top">Too short a depth of field. Everything else is great!</td>', 'Too short a depth of field. Everything else is great!', '2010-03-09 20:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897293, 857812, 10785, '<td valign="top">Crop is not quite tight enough!</td>', 'Crop is not quite tight enough!', '2010-03-09 20:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897299, 858199, 10785, '<td valign="top">Not quite close enough... There is too much black space here.</td>', 'Not quite close enough... There is too much black space here.', '2010-03-09 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897310, 858203, 112781, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I am not completely getting the relationship of the egg and guitar, but the title kind of sheds some light.  (egg is not parallel to the strings).   I like the lighting.  To complete the symmetry of this image detune the guitar so all tuning pegs are reflecting light the same way.  (ie. all like the low E, or like the A &amp; D stings) - 7</td>', 'Great photo.  I am not completely getting the relationship of the egg and guitar, but the title kind of sheds some light.  (egg is not parallel to the strings).   I like the lighting.  To complete the symmetry of this image detune the guitar so all tuning pegs are reflecting light the same way.  (ie. all like the low E, or like the A & D stings) - 7', '2010-03-09 20:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897313, 858058, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is very good for color and exposure. It might work a little better as presented if it was cropped a little off the top. I do like it though and think it would make a great menu shot.</td>', 'This is very good for color and exposure. It might work a little better as presented if it was cropped a little off the top. I do like it though and think it would make a great menu shot.', '2010-03-09 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897315, 857732, 112781, '<td valign="top">Creative use of your groceries...  I really like the high contrast and the color.  This would work well as a logo for some dairy or organic foods company.</td>', 'Creative use of your groceries...  I really like the high contrast and the color.  This would work well as a logo for some dairy or organic foods company.', '2010-03-09 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897323, 858057, 112781, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo. How did you get him to co-operate and stay in the egg?</td>', 'This is an excellent photo. How did you get him to co-operate and stay in the egg?', '2010-03-09 20:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897355, 857732, 96572, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I hope this does really well. Best of luck!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-03-10 00:18:00.</i></td>', 'Awesome! I hope this does really well. Best of luck!', '2010-03-09 20:49:33.000000', '2010-03-10 00:18:00.000000', 1),
