(5897366, 856615, 96572, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Wow! I had to take a double take on this picture.  I was like, good lighting, sharp, clear, good boarder ... I was like nice vase ... than where is the egg?!? There it is ... the vase is the egg! Good job! Super creative! This has to do really well! Super! Soooooo creative!!!!!!!!</td>', 'Awesome! Wow! I had to take a double take on this picture.  I was like, good lighting, sharp, clear, good boarder ... I was like nice vase ... than where is the egg?!? There it is ... the vase is the egg! Good job! Super creative! This has to do really well! Super! Soooooo creative!!!!!!!!', '2010-03-09 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
