(5897495, 857045, 66041, '<td valign="top">ouch.  way too bright for me.   I might have toned down the exposure to get some of the egg and carton textures to show.     Not quite sure what the yellow should be.</td>', 'ouch.  way too bright for me.   I might have toned down the exposure to get some of the egg and carton textures to show.     Not quite sure what the yellow should be.', '2010-03-09 22:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897496, 858007, 66041, '<td valign="top">nice thought, but uneven and poor focus...</td>', 'nice thought, but uneven and poor focus...', '2010-03-09 22:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897501, 857944, 66041, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it''s a bit too grey for me</td>', 'I like the concept, but it''s a bit too grey for me', '2010-03-09 22:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5897503, 858135, 66041, '<td valign="top">I love the thought.   but in trying to include everything, your subjects seem far away.   I might have gone with a shorter candle and zoomed in more, maybe cutting off the top of the flowers and edge of bottle in order for your subjects to dominate the photo.<br/> <br/>Love the setup, and excellent use of sepia - although I wonder how it would look with just desaturation rather than sepia - I''d love to compare the two.</td>', 'I love the thought.   but in trying to include everything, your subjects seem far away.   I might have gone with a shorter candle and zoomed in more, maybe cutting off the top of the flowers and edge of bottle in order for your subjects to dominate the photo. Love the setup, and excellent use of sepia - although I wonder how it would look with just desaturation rather than sepia - I''d love to compare the two.', '2010-03-09 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
