(5898412, 858070, 28322, '<td valign="top">I agree it is un original, the language which the chick has marked inside the egg is known, you should''ve invented your own language .. shame on you :) <br/>Man even if this idea has been presented before, you really got the best out of it, I like it .. I didn''t vote this challenge, but if I did, It would''ve been a straight 10. <br/>P.S, Like if all the poses in photography haven''t been used millions of times before :) <br/>Cheers mate,</td>', 'I agree it is un original, the language which the chick has marked inside the egg is known, you should''ve invented your own language .. shame on you :) Man even if this idea has been presented before, you really got the best out of it, I like it .. I didn''t vote this challenge, but if I did, It would''ve been a straight 10. P.S, Like if all the poses in photography haven''t been used millions of times before :) Cheers mate,', '2010-03-10 10:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
