(5899140, 857401, 109363, '<td valign="top">_______________THANK YOU for all you nice comments.______________<br/> <br/>This was one of the most fun shots i''ve done for this site... and apparently one of mine that has drawn a lot of skepticism about my methods.  The photo was challenged and validated by the site council.  i guess i''ll be careful about "lettering" in my shots in the future, so as not to draw the ire of the doubters ;-)<br/> <br/>THANKS AGAIN!<br/> <br/>-mefnj</td>', '_______________THANK YOU for all you nice comments.______________ This was one of the most fun shots i''ve done for this site... and apparently one of mine that has drawn a lot of skepticism about my methods.  The photo was challenged and validated by the site council.  i guess i''ll be careful about "lettering" in my shots in the future, so as not to draw the ire of the doubters ;-) THANKS AGAIN! -mefnj', '2010-03-10 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
