(5901151, 856615, 108544, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your well placed finish. Yeah a ribbon baby! lol Although, I still am trying to figure how you got a one vote and four 2''s. Makes me wonder, did they even notice the egg?<br/>Ahh well, keep on smiling. Great work!!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your well placed finish. Yeah a ribbon baby! lol Although, I still am trying to figure how you got a one vote and four 2''s. Makes me wonder, did they even notice the egg?Ahh well, keep on smiling. Great work!!!', '2010-03-12 10:58:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5901164, 858021, 108544, '<td valign="top">Nice job! I am so glad, you placed as well as you did. It just seems images like this one, could be voted so many ways. Don''t get me wrong, it''s a grate image and well deserved placing. It seems though, creativity like this, can be overlooked here.<br/>So I am very pleased for the most part, that it was not. Interesting vote breakdown too. Yeah, 21 - 10''s is pretty impressive. So keep on smiling...</td>', 'Nice job! I am so glad, you placed as well as you did. It just seems images like this one, could be voted so many ways. Don''t get me wrong, it''s a grate image and well deserved placing. It seems though, creativity like this, can be overlooked here.So I am very pleased for the most part, that it was not. Interesting vote breakdown too. Yeah, 21 - 10''s is pretty impressive. So keep on smiling...', '2010-03-12 11:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
