(5901484, 857401, 111625, '<td valign="top">15 1s that should all not be counted.  How many of those people are voting like that because they felt that it didn''t follow the rules when the rules clearly state that you don''t knock a pic if you feel it doesn''t follow the rules.  This deserved a much better score for sure</td>', '15 1s that should all not be counted.  How many of those people are voting like that because they felt that it didn''t follow the rules when the rules clearly state that you don''t knock a pic if you feel it doesn''t follow the rules.  This deserved a much better score for sure', '2010-03-12 15:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
